@MinimalEP_HostAddress = http://localhost:5284

### ============================================================
### Scenario-based .http tests live in the Http/ folder:
###   01-Auth.http          - register/login/refresh/token reuse
###   02-Employee-Me.http   - self-service profile + employee lookup
###   03-Admin-Roles.http   - admin account creation & role assignment
###   04-Customer.http      - customer CRUD scenarios
###   05-Workload.http      - punch-clock start/stop/update/delete flows
### Run the app first (dotnet run), the database and roles are created
### automatically on startup if they do not already exist.
